    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Specifying remote Nix expressions, such as the one provided by Nixpkgs, can be done in several ways:",
      "source_hash": 11108616256711083568,
      "context_hash": 5913467070398583607,
      "translation": "Nixpkgs가 제공하는 것과 같은 원격 Nix 표현식을 지정하는 방법은 여러 가지가 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Nix expressions": "Nix 표현식",
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:14.953459Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[`$NIX_PATH` environment variable](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/command-ref/env-common.html#env-NIX_PATH)",
      "source_hash": 11418817129492322301,
      "context_hash": 17806003282906932130,
      "translation": "[`$NIX_PATH` 환경 변수](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/command-ref/env-common.html#env-NIX_PATH)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:14.953460Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[`-I` option](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/command-ref/opt-common.html#opt-I) to most commands like `nix-build`, `nix-shell`, etc.",
      "source_hash": 7159827120510279060,
      "context_hash": 3168469147819276808,
      "translation": "`nix-build`, `nix-shell` 등 대부분의 명령어에 사용하는 [`-I` 옵션](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/command-ref/opt-common.html#opt-I)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "option": "옵션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:14.953460Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[`fetchurl`](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-fetchurl), [`fetchTarball`](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-fetchTarball), [`fetchGit`](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-fetchGit) or [Nixpkgs fetchers](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/#chap-pkgs-fetchers) in Nix expressions",
      "source_hash": 12845278046787449890,
      "context_hash": 4270812295975496569,
      "translation": "Nix 표현식 안의 [`fetchurl`](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-fetchurl), [`fetchTarball`](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-fetchTarball), [`fetchGit`](https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-fetchGit) 또는 [Nixpkgs fetcher](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/#chap-pkgs-fetchers)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Nix expressions": "Nix 표현식",
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:14.953460Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Possible URL values",
